<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Pride - 130,000 tonnes coal Gladstone and Newcastle/Taranto $12.50 fio 35,000 shinc/30,000 shinc 16-25/5 Coe and Clerici.</p>
<p>M.N.Istanbul - 120,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Le Havre $7 fio scale load/25,000 shinc 10-24/5 Kleimar.</p>
<p>TBN - 100,000 tonnes coal Norfolk/Constanza $7.25 fio 30,000 shinc/20,000 shex end April RTE.</p>
<p>Great Nancy - 60,000 tonnes coal Roberts Bank/Fos $12.60 fio 25,000 shinc/25,000 shinc end April Cobelfret.</p>
<p>ORE - There were no fresh ore fixtures reported on Monday.</p>
</text>
